Organizing directory nested inside a described archive, mirroring en/messages/ and fr/messages/. Holds this language's interface message catalogs, gettext .po files, split by bin/ and lib/ the same way: no sidecar, no work, no Dublin Core. Empty for now: no catalog has been extracted or translated into Spanish yet. When sat's interface_language is set to es, prompts, feedback, and everything sat read reports would come from these catalogs once they exist.
